Package: kyronext-installer-launcher
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Depends: sudo, calamares
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Kyronext Systems <on3egs@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Live-only Kyronext installer launcher
 Provides a narrowly scoped launcher for Calamares in the Kyronext Live
 session. The package is removed from the installed system.
